{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFlowers for You\u201d is a gentle adventure game where you create custom bouquets based on each customer\u2019s story as a florist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in modern Japan, listen to faded memories and craft floral arrangements that bring color back into their lives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deliver your own bouquet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive an order, create your bouquet. The story will change depending on the bouquet you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also enjoy the bouquets you created in the photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.poster.avif?t=1766418052\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.webm?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.mp4?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >People's stories intersect at the florist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people who visit your florist shop are all living with faded memories somewhere in their hearts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to their stories and touch their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.poster.avif?t=1766418052\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.webm?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.mp4?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo, the capital of modern Japan. The stories of the people who live there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story diverges depending on the bouquet of flowers you offer, rather than on your choice of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm illustrations in the style of a picture book and gentle colors create an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi music that fits well with the peaceful atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game makes players think and feel. A game experience that soothes the mind and body.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The images are under development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345140?t=1766418052","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3345140?t=1766418052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/a3229a0459f50350e24e732a45c5712d4ded75ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766418052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/a3229a0459f50350e24e732a45c5712d4ded75ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766418052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFlowers for You\u201d is a gentle adventure game where you create custom bouquets based on each customer\u2019s story as a florist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in modern Japan, listen to faded memories and craft floral arrangements that bring color back into their lives.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deliver your own bouquet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive an order, create your bouquet. The story will change depending on the bouquet you offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also enjoy the bouquets you created in the photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.poster.avif?t=1766418052\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.webm?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/94aa1293a03ae5344452c7909f395dc9.mp4?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >People's stories intersect at the florist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people who visit your florist shop are all living with faded memories somewhere in their hearts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to their stories and touch their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.poster.avif?t=1766418052\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.webm?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/extras/8e55b176ef39f19f2ed12d756f484fdc.mp4?t=1766418052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo, the capital of modern Japan. The stories of the people who live there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story diverges depending on the bouquet of flowers you offer, rather than on your choice of dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm illustrations in the style of a picture book and gentle colors create an immersive experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-fi music that fits well with the peaceful atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game makes players think and feel. A game experience that soothes the mind and body.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The images are under development.</p>","developers":["abyss good games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345140/67336049c9782c1f37e54a2fdedc9986ec94a191/header.jpg?t=1766418052","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2D Art, Character Design, Logo Design : Yuka Someyama <br />\r\nSound : MURASAKI","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3345140/728689874/3bd8575a9001c9f5b66a0ca40825d4e64e5c0184/1751887715/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751891394","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3345140/728689874/3bd8575a9001c9f5b66a0ca40825d4e64e5c0184/1751887715/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751891394","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3345140/728689874/3bd8575a9001c9f5b66a0ca40825d4e64e5c0184/1751887715/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751891394","id":257160697,"name":"\u4e88\u544a\u7de8","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257160697/ab2bfd35629c09d58eb803a27ddc6698eb606bfb/movie